  {
   "id": "crush-annotations-md-7",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "```text\n[capabilities] … needs capabilities this run does not grant; nothing was run:\n  not available in this host: ai_native.semantic_match\n```\n\nThe one AI statement with Crush syntax, `semantic_switch`, parses but is refused\nat compile time, because it would have compiled to a silent no-op (crush-ast\nCRUSH-265):\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
